  "description": "**** Apply by emailing a reply to this advertisement only - no phone calls please*** \n\nThis beautiful, large first floor apartment is located in one of Howth's prime locations in the village with an array of local amenties to benefit from including cafes, restaurants, bars, shops and seafront walks. \n\nSpacious accommodation comprises kitchen/dining room, 2 double bedrooms and bathroom.  Views of Howth Church from the feature lounge windows. The main bedroom opens onto a sunny balcony. Great condition throughout.\n\nHowth DART station is approx 10 mins walk making this a great location from which to commute to Dublin City Centre. A regular bus service also services the area.",
